00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:41,000
Can't Buy My Love is a romance, tv movie film directed by Farhad Mann.

2
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:16,000
Lilly, a hard working EMT, is only focused on her
job and getting into medical school.

3
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:51,000
So when wealthy slacker Jeff enters her life it throws her off course.

4
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:26,000
At first, Lilly wants nothing to do with Jeff or his
sense of entitlement and lack of direction.

5
00:17:55,000 --> 00:18:01,000
As she spends more time with him, she starts to realize that
you can’t always judge a book by its cover.

6
